    <string name="local_model_howto">Install on iQOO 15</string>
    <string name="local_model_howto_body">Edge Gallery cannot share its private copy with this app. Downloading Gemma there does not install it here.\n\n1. In this app: System → Download Gemma 3 1B (INT4 .task). That is the file Ask uses.\n2. Or export/share gemma3-1b-it-int4.task into Downloads, then tap Use Gemma file in Downloads / Import.\n3. Turn on “Use local model when available”, then open Ask SMRITI.\n4. NPU .litertlm files from Edge Gallery will not load here — use the MediaPipe .task.\n\nAsk still works with rules if no model is installed. Never rely on the model for leak confirmation.</string>
